  "extra_prompt": "You are booking for an interior designer. Ask about the property, rooms involved, budget range, style preferences, and timeline. Ask whether it is design only, design + supply, or full project management. Quote prices only from the reference answers, and say the final price is confirmed after consultation. Do not promise a specific design outcome or supplier availability not in the reference answers.",
  "kb": [
    {
      "q": "How much do you charge?",
      "a": "{price_note} Design fees can be hourly, per room, or a percentage of the project. We confirm which applies when we quote.",
      "keywords": "price,fee,hourly,per room",
      "priority": 10
    },
    {
      "q": "Do you do e-design?",
      "a": "Yes, we offer remote e-design packages. You send us room measurements and photos, and we send you the design plan.",
      "keywords": "e-design,remote,measurements,photos",
      "priority": 9
    },
    {
      "q": "Do you do residential and commercial work?",
      "a": "Yes, we work on homes, offices, retail, and hospitality spaces.",
      "keywords": "residential,commercial,retail,hospitality",
      "priority": 9
    },
    {
      "q": "Do you do property styling?",
      "a": "Yes, we style properties for sale and for rent. Tell us the timing, such as an open house date, when you book.",
      "keywords": "styling,sale,rent,open house",
      "priority": 9
    },
    {
      "q": "Do you manage the project?",
      "a": "Yes, we can manage the project from concept to completion. Project management is priced as a share of the build cost, and we confirm the percentage in your quote.",
      "keywords": "project management,build cost,percentage",
      "priority": 9
    },
    {
      "q": "Do you supply furniture?",
      "a": "Yes, we source and supply furniture, lighting, and finishes. We show you options before anything is ordered.",
      "keywords": "furniture,lighting,finishes,source",
      "priority": 9
    },
    {
      "q": "Can you work with my builder?",
      "a": "Yes, we coordinate with builders and trades. We share plans and specifications so the build matches the design.",
      "keywords": "builder,trades,plans,specifications",
      "priority": 9
    },
    {
      "q": "Do you do kitchen and bathroom design?",
      "a": "Yes, we design kitchens, bathrooms, and laundries, including layout and finishes.",
      "keywords": "kitchen,bathroom,laundry,layout",
      "priority": 8
    },
    {
      "q": "Do you do 3D visuals?",
      "a": "Yes, we provide 3D renders for larger projects. Tell us the scope, and we will confirm whether renders are included.",
      "keywords": "3D,renders,visuals,scope",
      "priority": 8
    },
    {
      "q": "What is your minimum project?",
      "a": "{minimum_note} Tell us the scope and budget when you call.",
      "keywords": "minimum,project,scope,budget",
      "priority": 8
    },
    {
      "q": "Do you charge a consultation fee?",
      "a": "{consult_note} Tell us what you want to achieve so we can make the most of the visit.",
      "keywords": "consultation,fee,visit",
      "priority": 9
    },
    {
      "q": "How long does a project take?",
      "a": "Design-only projects usually take [number] weeks. Full projects depend on the build schedule, which we confirm with your builder.",
      "keywords": "how long,project,weeks,build",
      "priority": 8
    },
    {
      "q": "Do you work outside the local area?",
      "a": "Yes, we travel to projects outside the local area. Travel fees may apply, and we show them in your quote.",
      "keywords": "travel,outside,local area,fees",
      "priority": 8
    },
    {
      "q": "Do you offer colour consulting?",
      "a": "Yes, colour consulting is available as a standalone service. We can also include it in a full design.",
      "keywords": "colour,consulting,standalone,design",
      "priority": 8
    },
    {
      "q": "Do you do home staging?",
      "a": "Yes, we stage homes for sale and for rent. Home staging is charged per week, so tell us how long the property needs to be staged.",
      "keywords": "home staging,weekly,sale,rent",
      "priority": 8
    },
    {
      "q": "Are you insured?",
      "a": "Our insurer is [insurer name] and our policy number is [policy number]. We can send a certificate before you book.",
      "keywords": "insured,insurance,certificate",
      "priority": 8
    }
  ],
